"name": "Genesis Energy, L.P.",
"description": "Genesis Energy LP engages in the provision of midstream services. It operates through the following segments: Offshore Pipeline Transportation, Marine Transportation, and Onshore Transportation and Services. The Offshore Pipeline Transportation segment deals with transportation and processing of crude oil and natural gas. The Marine Transportation segment provides waterborne transportation for petroleum products and crude oil. The Onshore Transportation segment and Services segment manage transportation and facilities services for crude oil and refined products as well as sulfur removal services. The company was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Houston, TX.",
